        "quote": "正式出院带药单"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02475",
        "explanation": "The final visible event is a new family question about home emergency thresholds after receiving the formal medication sheet, with no subsequent doctor response.",
        "quote": "回家后哪些情况是不能等门诊、必须直接急诊的？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "The episode remained open at the turn limit with a clinically important discharge-anticoagulation safety-net question unanswered. Prior inpatient plans were often executable, but the final home medication and emergency-escalation issue was not closed.",
