        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor consistently framed pneumonia/influenza-associated pulmonary infection with dyspnea as requiring inpatient monitoring and did not treat normal temperature or one SpO2 value as definitive reassurance.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
