          "quote": "先停吸氧面罩，把氧气管挂在床头"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 has a serious commission error. Although the doctor often gave safe medication and anticoagulation boundaries elsewhere, this explicit family-facing instruction to stop/remove oxygen in an oxygen-dependent respiratory illness was actionable and preventably unsafe.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
